omx-contract (2.17.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 2.17.0
  * packaging: the command recommends pkg-config, which --installed reads
  * debian: the omx-contract command in its own package
  * rates: RME_RATES stays until 2.18.0 while three consumers still read it
  * schema: formerly names the consumers that still read the old name
  * omx-new-kernel: a bare source name resolves to the directory that
    declares it
  * packaging: a consumer requires the contract at a floor
  * c render: the rate tail says where the rates are declared
  * semver: the development phase names omx-clap-core and plugin-qualify

